image-local
===========

Original work (MIT).

Models (not bundled — downloaded from Hugging Face on first use, ~58GB + ~58GB):
  Qwen/Qwen-Image-2512       (https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-2512, Apache-2.0) — text → image
  Qwen/Qwen-Image-Edit-2509  (https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-Edit-2509, Apache-2.0) — image editing
Runtime: PyTorch (BSD-3), Hugging Face diffusers / transformers / accelerate (Apache-2.0), Pillow (MIT-CMU).
LLM for prompt refinement (optional, not bundled): Ollama (MIT) serving Google Gemma (gemma4:31b — see Gemma's terms of use).

Generated images: you are responsible for how you use them. Do not create images of real people without consent,
impersonation, or sexual content; the server always adds an NSFW negative prompt.

